+/* scaleplex: process-wide libass lock. libass is not reentrant across
+ * its shared state (fontconfig, FreeType cache, font provider). In
+ * jellyfin-ffmpeg 7.x the decoder, filter, and main threads can each
+ * call libass entry points concurrently. A per-filter mutex isn't
+ * enough — Plex 6.x runs the transcode loop single-threaded so the
+ * shared-state contention never surfaces. One file-scope mutex covers
+ * every libass call site below. Contention is negligible at homelab
